{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, רוּחַ","hw":"רוּחַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">Dn 5:12</a></sup> <strong>wind, spirit</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">Dn 5:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:4\" href=\"/Daniel.6.4\">6:4</a>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:5\" href=\"/Daniel.4.5\">4:5</a> +, emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:35\" href=\"/Daniel.2.35\">2:35</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:15\" href=\"/Daniel.7.15\">7:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הּ—ֵ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:20\" href=\"/Daniel.5.20\">5:20</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:2\" href=\"/Daniel.7.2\">7:2</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>wind</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:35\" href=\"/Daniel.2.35\">Dn 2:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:2\" href=\"/Daniel.7.2\">7:2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>spirit:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  of man, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:20\" href=\"/Daniel.5.20\">5:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:15\" href=\"/Daniel.7.15\">7:15</a>; as faculty of knowledge, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ יַתִּירָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">5:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:4\" href=\"/Daniel.6.4\">6:4</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ אֱלָהִין קַדִּישִׁין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:5\" href=\"/Daniel.4.5\">4:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:15\" href=\"/Daniel.4.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">5:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ א׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:14\" href=\"/Daniel.5.14\">14</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, רֵיחַ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, רוח"}